  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize forming a pure sequence first - you cannot win without it. Use jokers wisely to complete sets and impure sequences. Discard high-value cards early if they don't fit into combinations.\n\nTrack discards to know which cards are safe to discard. Watch opponents' picks from the discard pile to deduce their combinations. Balance between completing your hand and not giving away useful cards.\n\nCalculate probabilities of drawing needed cards. Use deceptive discards to mislead opponents about your hand. Know when to hold versus when to fold (in points variants). Bluff by picking cards you don't need.",
    Player: "Prioritize forming a pure sequence first - you cannot win without it. Use jokers wisely to complete sets and impure sequences. Discard high-value cards early if they don't fit into combinations.\n\nTrack discards to know which cards are safe to discard. Watch opponents' picks from the discard pile to deduce their combinations. Balance between completing your hand and not giving away useful cards.\n\nCalculate probabilities of drawing needed cards. Use deceptive discards to mislead opponents about your hand. Know when to hold versus when to fold (in points variants). Bluff by picking cards you don't need.",
